---
import '../../styles/quick-decision.css';
import OutlineIcon from '../shared/OutlineIcon.astro';
---

<section class="quick-decision-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quick-decision-card">
      <div class="quick-decision-copy">
        <p class="label muted">Quick parent decision grid</p>
        <h2>See the decisions this webinar helps you make faster</h2>
        <p>
          Before you go deeper, here is the exact kind of clarity this ₹99 session is designed to give Mumbai parents
          of Class 8–10 students.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="quick-decision-grid">
        <article>
          <span><OutlineIcon name="compass" size={18} /></span>
          <h3>Science, Commerce or Arts?</h3>
          <p>Compare stream fit without relying only on marks, fear, or coaching pressure.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span><OutlineIcon name="brain" size={18} /></span>
          <h3>Marks or real fit?</h3>
          <p>Separate academic performance from aptitude, personality, and longer-term suitability.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span><OutlineIcon name="heart-handshake" size={18} /></span>
          <h3>How should parents discuss careers?</h3>
          <p>Learn calmer language for career conversations without panic, conflict, or resistance at home.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span><OutlineIcon name="badge-check" size={18} /></span>
          <h3>Is deeper assessment needed?</h3>
          <p>Understand when a child may benefit from a structured aptitude and personality evaluation.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
